Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Stand up tall, reach out your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.68,0:00:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut through the wind and make a stand!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.88,0:00:11.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The paint within brings\Nout a map of your own.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.98,0:00:19.60,Default,,0,0,0,,To the left and the right\Nall we saw stormy nights.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.68,0:00:22.86,Default,,0,0,0,,All the rough winds and\Nwaves coming day after day?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.94,0:00:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And the values we had were about to\Ncollapse Oh just where do we go next?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.88,0:00:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And as we look down to the compass in\Nhand Is it showing us the right direction?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.74,0:00:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,All we know is nobody\Nhere knows it for certain.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.72,0:00:41.94,Default,,0,0,0,,So close your eyes and breathe in deeply.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.02,0:00:45.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And listen to your soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.26,0:00:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll see a path in front of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.20,0:00:51.54,Default,,0,0,0,,And you'll know just where you need to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.62,0:00:55.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So stand up tall, reach out your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.90,0:00:59.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut through the wind and make us stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.10,0:01:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let the darkness\Nwin. Just break through.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.62,0:01:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll do it my own way,\Nthat's what's best for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.22,0:01:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,And you do it your way,\Nthat's how it's got to be.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.86,0:01:15.40,Default,,0,0,0,,We're moving forward. Now I'm ready.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.48,0:01:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,But at times it's okay\Nto get help on the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.30,0:01:21.76,Default,,0,0,0,,For the future ahead, burning bright.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.84,0:01:24.28,Default,,0,0,0,,For what's ahead you see.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.36,0:01:27.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Is beyond your wildest dreams.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.60,0:01:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,So stand up tall, reach out your hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.84,0:01:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut through the wind and make a stand.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.06,0:01:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let the darkness\Nwin. Just break through.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.48,0:01:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll do it our way,\Nthe best that we know.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.16,0:01:45.54,Default,,0,0,0,,With tears and doubts and tone.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.62,0:01:47.92,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll go where we all wanna go.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.00,0:01:53.72,Default,,0,0,0,,The page within brings colors of our own.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.26,0:01:58.66,Default,,0,0,0,,To be
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.74,0:02:05.74,Default,,0,0,0,,continued...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.66,0:02:34.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry, this way! Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.40,0:02:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn, we're trapped here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.40,0:02:44.23,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.31,0:02:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,The heat will kill us before we get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.30,0:02:55.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, this is it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.88,0:03:11.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You're Jinbe from the\NStraw Hats! Thank you!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.32,0:03:12.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You're really strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.12,0:03:14.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Head the opposite way.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.46,0:03:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,The fire hasn't spread there yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.92,0:03:18.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Just focus on surviving.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.34,0:03:20.17,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.26,0:03:21.56,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll save ourselves.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.64,0:03:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You stay safe too! Right! Now go!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.34,0:03:27.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.25,0:03:28.16,Default,,0,0,0,,You heard the man!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.08,0:03:44.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Why did the flames spread so quickly?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.96,0:03:47.67,Default,,0,0,0,,It's one thing for a\Nwarrior to die in battle,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.08,0:03:51.20,Default,,0,0,0,,but this fire will cause so\Nmany needless casualties!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.34,0:04:07.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's too dangerous to stay here now.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:08.12,0:04:10.32,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to run to some place safer.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.28,0:04:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong, Doctor?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.18,0:04:21.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Fighting for a nation!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.54,0:04:43.48,Default,,0,0,0,,She's back!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.14,0:04:44.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Yay!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.05,0:04:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Doctor!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.97,0:04:47.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm so glad!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.40,0:04:48.92,Default,,0,0,0,,And as an added bonus,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.24,0:04:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,now you, Karoo, know the side effects\Nof your extended gigantification.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.52,0:04:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, I thought something might\Nhappen, but I didn't expect that.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.06,0:05:00.48,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a fair payoff.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.94,0:05:05.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm stronger and bigger for longer,\Nbut weaker and smaller once it's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.74,0:05:09.68,Default,,0,0,0,,But that reminds me there's someone\Nelse dealing with side effects.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.92,0:05:13.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Miyagi, I'm worried\Nabout how Zoro's doing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.50,0:05:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed, it won't be pretty.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.92,0:05:22.45,Default,,0,0,0,,He had 20 or 30 bones broken and had\Ncountless other injuries on top of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.92,0:05:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,The medicine healed him instantly,\Nbut doesn't last forever.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.78,0:05:29.16,Default,,0,0,0,,When it's done, he'll hurt twice as bad?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.56,0:05:31.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.90,0:05:34.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Those wounds were bad\Nenough in the first place.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.84,0:05:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro, you better not die.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.94,0:06:29.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:29.68,0:06:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.50,0:06:45.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, no, what the hell's\Ngoing on? I can't,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.62,0:06:49.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't move, stay back, don't do it, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.12,0:06:58.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Out of my way!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.24,0:07:10.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I ain't got time for this crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.00,0:07:12.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I gotta find Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.16,0:07:23.18,Default,,0,0,0,,This isn't fair.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.36,0:07:26.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We had this till one of\NWhitemir's commanders stepped in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.18,0:07:29.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Why the hell is he hoping\NStraw Hat and the Samurai?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.24,0:07:49.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm a sloppy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.70,0:07:53.29,Default,,0,0,0,,The peace pirates aren't\Nto be trifled with.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.58,0:07:57.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Kaku, keep him up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.72,0:07:58.74,Default,,0,0,0,,It's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.92,0:08:00.27,Default,,0,0,0,,As long as you're safe.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.18,0:08:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Cypher-pull.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.86,0:08:18.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Indeed, we're Aegis Zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.30,0:08:21.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I was afraid this might happen.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.10,0:08:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Izo, we never saw each other.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.98,0:08:31.96,Default,,0,0,0,,To be clear, the Whitebeard pilots\Ncommitted a historical crime.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.20,0:08:34.67,Default,,0,0,0,,That's not something we can simply ignore.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.80,0:08:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,But our business is with the Straw Hats,\Nand that is more than enough for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.12,0:08:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm sure we'll meet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.26,0:08:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,We are not done here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.90,0:08:53.96,Default,,0,0,0,,CP Zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.22,0:09:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.98,0:09:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I can still make it!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:13.62,0:09:15.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you dare!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.18,0:09:21.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Wearing all hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.50,0:09:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And slips into the rain.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.30,0:09:28.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't do that! Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.36,0:09:29.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What is your deal?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.28,0:09:42.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.12,0:09:44.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Place your fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:59.02,0:10:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,If that thing so much as touches those\Nexplosives, everything will be over.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.48,0:10:10.01,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know where you came\Nfrom, but you can go right back!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.22,0:10:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Mahoropa!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.04,0:10:56.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough, Big Mom! Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.88,0:10:58.59,Default,,0,0,0,,They can't even move anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.76,0:10:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,You've won, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.44,0:11:02.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to kill them!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.64,0:11:04.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.86,0:11:06.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm begging you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.90,0:11:15.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Even your own men are pitying you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.60,0:11:18.31,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not a good look for\Nthe worst generation.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.82,0:11:23.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hurry up! Hmm?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.34,0:11:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,They want this by us!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.00,0:11:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Just run out a little\Nlonger and we'll save you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.32,0:11:31.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I need any medics to move in and\Ntake care of the captain right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.94,0:11:32.77,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.14,0:11:41.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Screw off, you punks!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.86,0:11:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a proper duel!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.60,0:11:45.04,Default,,0,0,0,,And we're not done!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.54,0:11:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,God of lightning, Timton, heed my call!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.72,0:11:53.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.08,0:11:57.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Straight into the rubbish\Npile, right where you belong.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.46,0:11:59.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Nom, nom, nom, nom!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.88,0:12:09.70,Default,,0,0,0,,You know, it's funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.06,0:12:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought Kaido would have\Nannounced his victory by now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.94,0:12:18.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't tell me he's still\Nfooling around with Straw Hat.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.82,0:12:20.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Put that brat in the ground already.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.00,0:12:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,He's just a little punk.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.76,0:12:26.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Kara, let's go to the rooftop.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.16,0:12:28.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.52,0:12:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Sounds like fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.92,0:12:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm pooped after all this.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.86,0:12:35.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's get the hell out of here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:36.98,0:12:38.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama, Mama, Mama.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.06,0:12:43.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Turning your back on the enemy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.86,0:12:45.69,Default,,0,0,0,,K-Room.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.48,0:12:48.32,Default,,0,0,0,,It's time for anesthesia.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.40,0:12:51.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You're finished, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.56,0:13:06.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.22,0:13:08.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.80,0:13:12.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I think it just killed Big Mom! Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.86,0:13:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, wow.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.28,0:13:16.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't know Drop could do that.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.68,0:13:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I know I hurt you with this last time,\Nbut the incision isn't the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.82,0:13:25.12,Default,,0,0,0,,This is...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.18,0:13:33.14,Default,,0,0,0,,No, let's not be hasty.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.18,0:13:35.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Chaka!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.46,0:13:52.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.56,0:13:57.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.40,0:14:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:05.58,0:14:07.22,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.40,0:14:12.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.96,0:14:16.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Something's pulling me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.38,0:14:27.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You're steel beams, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.28,0:14:28.72,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't need to talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.12,0:14:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You're all working for me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.22,0:14:38.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You still got some vibes. Not bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.48,0:14:43.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You must really want my head,\Nyou stubborn little brass.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.94,0:14:44.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.54,0:14:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,I did want your head,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.48,0:14:55.30,Default,,0,0,0,,but all of a sudden I feel I'm\Nbeing driven by a different purpose.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.38,0:14:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I have a feeling Kaido's\Nend is coming soon, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.36,0:15:07.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Even raindrops can wear away stone\Nif you give them long enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.78,0:15:10.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You think you're invincible?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.42,0:15:12.16,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no such thing!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.58,0:15:16.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You just haven't faced\Nanyone persistent enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.40,0:15:20.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Baaahhh! PUNK!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.80,0:15:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Turn TOO!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.66,0:15:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.58,0:15:51.11,Default,,0,0,0,,She's super-sized and\Nit's bigger than her!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.60,0:15:55.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:55.51,0:15:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Listen up, you old nasty hag!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.36,0:16:00.88,Default,,0,0,0,,We're gonna drive you straight to hell!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.32,0:16:02.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.44,0:16:04.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Get in on that road!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.44,0:16:32.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's working!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.86,0:16:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Onigashima is moving backward!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.86,0:16:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll drag it as far away\Nfrom the capital as possible!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.40,0:16:45.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You will not harm my people!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.02,0:16:50.00,Default,,0,0,0,,You will not reach the land of\NWano so long as I draw breath!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.24,0:16:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Did someone call out to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.40,0:17:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,That thing just sent her flying!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.10,0:17:20.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Mub's not actually\Ngoing to lose this, is she?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.28,0:17:42.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I finally got you to shut up for a\Nsecond. Hey, you—you did it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.24,0:17:49.10,Default,,0,0,0,,that's two times now I did a powerful\Nmove and you followed my lead with
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.18,0:17:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,something big and flashy acting\Nlike you one get your ego in check
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.62,0:17:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,because i'm not your opening act my\Nego nobody here gives a crap except you
Dialogue: 0,0:17:58.52,0:18:02.32,Default,,0,0,0,,all right then why don't you attack\Nher first next time anybody's
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.40,0:18:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,strongest technique didn't let me\Nfinish her off now screw that you're not
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.84,0:18:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,my boss besides the next move i do\Nis gonna wipe her out with or without
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.72,0:18:15.72,Default,,0,0,0,,you oh yeah what comes after the\Nbull a hippo an elephant SHUT UP!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.90,0:18:17.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I AIN'T GONNA TELL YOU CRAP!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.10,0:18:21.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, jeez.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.44,0:18:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Watch your mouth, Law, or the\Nboss is gonna kill you next.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.06,0:18:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, look!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.82,0:18:43.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Shock waves inside my body.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.64,0:18:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh my ribs must be broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.66,0:18:48.34,Default,,0,0,0,,That's quite the dangerous technique.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.22,0:18:51.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Hear that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.16,0:18:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Even she thinks it's cool.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.64,0:18:53.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Real funny.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:53.96,0:18:55.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Now will you drop it already?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.32,0:18:56.15,Default,,0,0,0,,You dick.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.82,0:19:02.08,Default,,0,0,0,,A life force should fix things.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.36,0:19:05.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, Bones, come to life!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.38,0:19:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, Mama!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.24,0:19:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,This is serious, so listen.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.60,0:19:27.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I've only got enough left\Nin me for one more attack.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.46,0:19:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got to finish\Nthis with the next shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.72,0:19:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't intend to lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.30,0:19:32.72,Default,,0,0,0,,So what I need you to do...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.80,0:19:33.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I just said you're not my boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.92,0:19:35.33,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't want to hear it!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.08,0:19:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Prometheus!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.02,0:19:40.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Napoleon!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.74,0:19:42.57,Default,,0,0,0,,Hera!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.82,0:19:44.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go! Ready, Mama?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.22,0:19:49.12,Default,,0,0,0,,I could do this all day!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.32,0:19:52.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Masira Saber!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.52,0:20:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's just scraps!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.20,0:20:09.10,Default,,0,0,0,,You're wasting your time!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.40,0:20:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,This was always a waste of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.18,0:20:14.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You were dead the moment\Nyou picked this fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.62,0:20:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I've sunk hundreds of boats like you.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:17.22,0:20:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I was ruling when you\Nwere still in diapers.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.70,0:20:23.78,Default,,0,0,0,,My power is absolute. Best for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.96,0:20:25.61,Default,,0,0,0,,to be an emperor of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.34,0:20:27.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Now a side!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.32,0:20:29.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Ah!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.58,0:20:30.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.52,0:20:33.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Yen!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.80,0:20:40.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, what are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.46,0:20:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.66,0:20:53.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Papa, get away!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.22,0:20:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm stuck!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.88,0:21:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,She used the tower to block it?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.06,0:21:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Why don't you take a head drop dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.00,0:21:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Stupid brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.16,0:21:16.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You must learn your place.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.60,0:21:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Mother's visit. Cannon!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:21.62,0:21:24.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Three thousand leagues of misery!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.08,0:21:51.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is that thing?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.24,0:22:13.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't escape me!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.44,0:22:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Our attack is chasing us down.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.68,0:22:36.60,Default,,0,0,0,,It's alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.46,0:23:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Ma-ma-ma-ma-ma!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.68,0:23:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to finish them all!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.76,0:23:16.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Put those little punks\Nin the ground, Misery!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.60,0:23:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Now tucked!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.54,0:23:49.88,Default,,0,0,0,,K-Room.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.34,0:23:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,K-Room.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.56,0:24:04.12,Default,,0,0,0,,This trick I can't revolve her!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:08.80,0:24:10.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that a sword?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:21.12,0:24:22.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You'll pay for that.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.88,0:24:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got some balls on you!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:28.12,0:24:31.04,Default,,0,0,0,,How long did you sit\Nhere to hold on to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:37.66,0:24:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.70,0:24:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing, Captain?\NLet go! You're gonna die!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:42.66,0:24:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not worth it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.56,0:24:49.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Deeper. Deeper.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.94,0:24:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Just a little more.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.60,0:24:53.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This is pointless.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.32,0:24:57.09,Default,,0,0,0,,You really wanted me to\Nbeat you to death, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:06.40,0:25:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Now puncture.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:08.70,0:25:09.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:09.61,0:25:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing? Fall!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:38.70,0:25:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.60,0:25:41.52,Default,,0,0,0,,A giant hole?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:42.50,0:25:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did that come from?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:01.10,0:26:02.81,Default,,0,0,0,,What are they doing up there?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:08.70,0:26:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Burn him to ash, Misery!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:13.72,0:26:15.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Eustass! Do it already!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.60,0:26:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.90,0:26:21.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Telling me what to do again, Trafalgar!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.46,0:26:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Just sit there and keep your mouth shut!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:34.84,0:26:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna ship me!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.36,0:26:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not scared of you, you nasty boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:45.94,0:26:47.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Give me your worst.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:47.30,0:26:49.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't beat Big Mom.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:50.34,0:26:52.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep telling yourself that.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.76,0:26:56.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Now jump. Mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.88,0:26:59.52,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't rule in our era.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:01.72,0:27:03.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Your time sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.36,0:27:25.62,Default,,0,0,0,,You pulled out all the stops this time.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.40,0:27:28.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Honestly, I'm impressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:34.64,0:27:37.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You boys must really like me.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:38.80,0:27:41.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't want our time together to end,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.64,0:27:44.35,Default,,0,0,0,,even though you can\Nbarely stand on your feet.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.74,0:27:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,You're young, of course,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.68,0:27:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,and you've got lots of energy, but I'm\Nmade of much sterner stuff than you.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.14,0:27:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You flats probably thought\Nyou'd driven me to the brink,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:56.30,0:27:59.42,Default,,0,0,0,,but try as you might, you can't defeat me!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.64,0:28:03.80,Default,,0,0,0,,She's not dead?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:03.98,0:28:05.54,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell is it gonna take?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.62,0:28:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,They've been kicking her ass, but\Nnow she's just laughing at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:09.62,0:28:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.94,0:28:13.16,Default,,0,0,0,,This is insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:14.30,0:28:16.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Kid and the captain are both spent.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:16.48,0:28:17.31,Default,,0,0,0,,We're screwed!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:18.04,0:28:23.68,Default,,0,0,0,,And when I do, your miserable little\Nlife will be putty in my hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.96,0:28:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll grant you what mercy.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:26.40,0:28:28.58,Default,,0,0,0,,You may choose your punishment.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.24,0:28:32.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Would you like to hand over\N50 years of your lifespan?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:33.06,0:28:37.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Or would you rather stay\Nas you are and be my slave?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:41.16,0:28:44.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Will it be life or slave?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:49.12,0:28:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,You took so much ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:51.80,0:28:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,That's enough, boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.26,0:28:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,We gotta book it!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.98,0:28:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.42,0:28:59.82,Default,,0,0,0,,She's taking her life pants too!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.90,0:29:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop it! Hi, boy! Hi, boy!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.08,0:29:08.91,Default,,0,0,0,,No!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:08.99,0:29:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't say anything but this!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:14.64,0:29:18.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought she was going to die,\Nthen she turns around and does this!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:18.76,0:29:20.02,Default,,0,0,0,,She's a monster!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.26,0:29:22.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to run!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:22.84,0:29:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,Get away from here, Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.60,0:29:33.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You guys should run.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.56,0:29:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,What a joke.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.06,0:29:38.35,Default,,0,0,0,,She thinks I'm scared.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.02,0:29:42.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Now I'm not giving you a damn thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.68,0:29:44.80,Default,,0,0,0,,And I'll never be your slave.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:45.32,0:29:46.82,Default,,0,0,0,,This is just a bluff.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.68,0:29:50.39,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got one foot in\Nthe grave, you old hag,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.50,0:29:53.32,Default,,0,0,0,,and your half-assed threats\Ndon't intimidate me!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.66,0:29:57.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't believe it!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.22,0:30:00.51,Default,,0,0,0,,Not even a second of their\Nlifespan has been taken away!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.74,0:30:02.39,Default,,0,0,0,,She's an emperor on the sea!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.52,0:30:05.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You're telling me they're\Nnot scared at all?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:08.94,0:30:09.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Roronoa.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:11.20,0:30:13.61,Default,,0,0,0,,As much as I'd like to relish my victory,
Dialogue: 0,0:30:14.02,0:30:16.37,Default,,0,0,0,,the dying screams will probably ruin it.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.78,0:30:18.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Unless I do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:18.84,0:30:21.24,Default,,0,0,0,,A gift from the man who saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.62,0:30:29.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop being such a sore loser\Nand take a hit, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:29.34,0:30:31.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The Underworld is waiting!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.56,0:30:34.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Let me help you on your way! It's silence!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.88,0:30:38.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:38.79,0:30:40.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Is something wrong with my ears?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:47.58,0:30:48.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Scream into the void.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:49.16,0:30:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,We've heard enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:51.24,0:30:53.42,Default,,0,0,0,,This technique cancels out all sound.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:57.76,0:30:59.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, didn't catch that.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.02,0:31:01.12,Default,,0,0,0,,What's happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:01.46,0:31:02.74,Default,,0,0,0,,My voice is gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.48,0:31:06.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain, look behind you!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.64,0:31:11.96,Default,,0,0,0,,And one more for the road!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:12.62,0:31:13.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Jack!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:44.38,0:31:45.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Prometheus!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:47.20,0:31:48.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Hera!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:51.46,0:31:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Anna!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:52.37,0:31:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.34,0:31:56.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Why aren't you helping me?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:59.58,0:32:00.46,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:00.90,0:32:02.12,Default,,0,0,0,,That big mom!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.82,0:32:06.16,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:06.48,0:32:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Everything's silent!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:09.68,0:32:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Nothing I touch makes the sound!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:13.30,0:32:17.36,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell have you done\Nto me, Trafalder? Whoa!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:17.68,0:32:18.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Let it go!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:28.56,0:32:29.66,Default,,0,0,0,,It's gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:49.52,0:32:50.35,Default,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.43,0:32:52.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that smoke?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:52.46,0:32:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:32:55.86,0:32:58.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Curse those stupid brats!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:58.86,0:33:01.60,Default,,0,0,0,,And curse you too, Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.44,0:33:08.82,Default,,0,0,0,,You just couldn't keep your mouth shut!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:09.28,0:33:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Why the hell did you have to go\Nand say that before you died?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:18.64,0:33:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,So you all want my treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.92,0:33:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, you can go ahead and have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:23.98,0:33:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,It's out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:26.44,0:33:28.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I left it in one place.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.56,0:33:30.27,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you just have to find it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:35.70,0:33:37.40,Default,,0,0,0,,People ain't bad up.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.68,0:33:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole world bought into it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.54,0:33:52.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Great pirate era, but what do you care?\NYou're dead. It's not your problem, is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.76,0:34:04.58,Default,,0,0,0,,All these brats got fired up\Nthanks to your little speech Roger!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.96,0:34:12.10,Default,,0,0,0,,And the pirates you left behind from your
Dialogue: 0,0:34:12.18,0:34:15.30,Default,,0,0,0,,generation we're the ones\Nwho have to deal with them.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.36,0:34:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,That doesn't sound good!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:38.78,0:34:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,We need to leave now!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.20,0:34:42.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Is there anyone there?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.56,0:34:45.26,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that noise?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:45.34,0:34:47.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:16.10,0:35:16.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Otter!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.56,0:35:25.78,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not fair, Otter.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.24,0:35:29.30,Default,,0,0,0,,You should have told us\Nbefore you left this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.64,0:35:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The One Piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.20,0:35:34.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Is the treasure even real?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.78,0:35:37.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.62,0:35:39.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.00,0:35:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It could be right beneath my\Nnose and I wouldn't have a clue.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:45.80,0:35:47.76,Default,,0,0,0,,It's so frustrating!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:00.28,0:36:01.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Kid!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:02.58,0:36:03.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.66,0:36:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,You won't get away with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.36,0:36:08.46,Default,,0,0,0,,My story isn't over.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:08.88,0:36:09.96,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.24,0:36:11.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Not like this, dammit.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.16,0:36:13.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I won't die.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.04,0:36:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Not from this!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.08,0:36:20.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Mark my words, I will be back!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:33.04,0:36:37.69,Default,,0,0,0,,The battle between Emperor of the Sea\NBig Mom and the New Generation has ended.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:40.26,0:36:43.42,Default,,0,0,0,,On the performance floor inside the skull
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.50,0:36:47.08,Default,,0,0,0,,dome a cheer rings out\Nthe winners are clear
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.96,0:36:58.12,Default,,0,0,0,,After a desperate struggle\NEustass captain kid
Dialogue: 0,0:36:59.90,0:37:03.32,Default,,0,0,0,,And his ally the surgeon of death
Dialogue: 0,0:37:03.40,0:37:08.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Trafalgar Law are victorious at last.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:08.72,0:37:11.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You did it, boss!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:13.40,0:37:14.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Captain!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.68,0:37:17.28,Default,,0,0,0,,You beat a new prophecy!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.26,0:37:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a big deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:19.68,0:37:21.44,Default,,0,0,0,,A really big deal!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:38.56,0:37:39.39,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:39.47,0:37:40.39,Default,,0,0,0,,So it's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:40.48,0:37:42.02,Default,,0,0,0,,But why have you come?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:48.92,0:37:49.82,Default,,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:49.90,0:37:51.72,Default,,0,0,0,,This will do for now, at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:53.14,0:37:53.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.05,0:37:56.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I knew you could do it,\NMomonosuke! Keep it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:58.28,0:37:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Yamato, it's you!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:59.46,0:38:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that the basement? Oh no!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:02.34,0:38:03.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It's exposed!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.18,0:38:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been a real mess.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:05.90,0:38:07.55,Default,,0,0,0,,Big Mom just set off a bomb.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.74,0:38:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,It blew out half the wall.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.20,0:38:11.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw the explosion earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.86,0:38:13.63,Default,,0,0,0,,So that was her doing, was it?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.24,0:38:15.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:15.18,0:38:17.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm lucky the whole armory didn't explode.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.34,0:38:20.99,Default,,0,0,0,,I was able to freeze everything,\Nso we should be safe for now.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:22.12,0:38:22.95,Default,,0,0,0,,That's good news.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.03,0:38:25.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm glad to see that you are unharmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:26.58,0:38:30.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm still fighting to do my part,\Nbut I need to tell you something.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:31.66,0:38:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We have a very large visitor coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.14,0:38:38.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you familiar with\NZunesha the giant elephant
Dialogue: 0,0:38:38.94,0:38:41.78,Default,,0,0,0,,the same one Odin wrote\Nabout in his journal?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:41.86,0:38:43.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Impossible. Papa!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:58.56,0:39:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Zunesha was a companion of Joy Boy\Nwho committed a crime 800 years ago.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.56,0:39:05.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What could it all mean?
